{"assets":["/statement-assets/92ba99e2d3aae62254cc10316d1aae92f599b95c2bbb8810a61ea65d766ca27e.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"917","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Stranger Trees"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Will shares a psychic connection with the Upside Down Monster, so everything the monster knows, Will knows. Suddenly, he started drawing, page after page, non-stop. Joyce, his mom, and Chief Hopper put the drawings together, and they realized, it's a labeled tree!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/92ba99e2d3aae62254cc10316d1aae92f599b95c2bbb8810a61ea65d766ca27e.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A tree is a connected acyclic graph. Will's tree has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertices. Joyce and Hopper don't know what that means, so they're investigating this tree and similar trees. For each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ k ≤ n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", they're going to investigate all labeled trees with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertices that share exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" edges with Will's tree. Two labeled trees are different if and only if there's a pair of vertices "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(v, u)"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that there's an edge between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" in one tree and not in the other one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hopper and Joyce want to know how much work they have to do, so they asked you to tell them the number of labeled trees with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertices that share exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" edges with Will's tree, for each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". The answer could be very large, so they only asked you to tell them the answers modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000000007 = 109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the size of the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the edges of Will's tree. Each line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ v, u ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v ≠ u"},{"kind":"text","text":"), endpoints of an edge. It is guaranteed that the given graph is a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers in one line. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th integer should be the number of the number of labeled trees with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertices that share exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" edges with Will's tree, modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000 000 007 = 109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 2\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 2 1 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2\n2 3\n3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 7 7 1 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2\n1 3\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 9 6 1 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"917D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/917/problem/D"}